						"description": "Get exam answer summary with statistics:\n- positive_count: Total correct answers\n- negative_count: Total wrong answers\n- empty_count: Total unanswered\n- obtained_marks: Final score\n- result_status: Pass/Fail\n- User's position in merit list\n- subject_breakdown: Performance breakdown by subject (correct/wrong/skipped per subject)\n- topic_breakdown: Performance breakdown by topic (correct/wrong/skipped per topic)"
